POST {{AthleteHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..o2vIpyNOfadWCBn6YAb4Qbds4guI0ecqoZW_voqQEOw

{
  "athleteId": 1,
  "termId": 1,
  "academicStatus": "ELIGIBLE",
  "remarks": "Approved for current term"
}

### Schedule/calendar entries
GET {{AthleteHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Schedules
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..SY0_Su5YJuH5-kTo4_mBeYAYmvmtdxOi0S1C4-U09Vo

### Schedule/calendar entries by date
GET {{AthleteHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Schedules?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..pvNGOGk0EXbSk2ZWCaurh9ZnSA0c_D-1Emznny5nA3g

### Create schedule - coach
POST {{AthleteHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Schedules
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..pvNGOGk0EXbSk2ZWCaurh9ZnSA0c_D-1Emznny5nA3g

{
  "title": "PRISAA Competition",
  "description": "Athletics competition",
  "scheduleType": "COMPETITION",
  "startDate": "2026-09-10",
  "startTime": "08:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-09-10",
