}

### Delete schedule
DELETE {{AthleteHub.API_HostAddress}}/api/Schedules/6
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..pvNGOGk0EXbSk2ZWCaurh9ZnSA0c_D-1Emznny5nA3g

